                        <li><a href="https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/semconv/messaging/messaging-spans/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry: Semantic conventions for messaging spans</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/sampling/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry: Sampling</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/sdk-configuration/general/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry: SDK configuration environment variables</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://sre.google/sre-book/monitoring-distributed-systems/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google SRE book: Monitoring distributed systems</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google SRE workbook: Alerting on SLOs</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://research.google/pubs/the-tail-at-scale/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dean and Barroso: The Tail at Scale</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/explore/service-map">Maple docs: Service map</a></li>
